<title>GREECE: GREEK 1M ATHIBOR FALLS TO 13.00 FROM 13.14PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1M ATHIBOR FALLS TO 13.00 FROM 13.14PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate</p>
<p>(Athibor) for one month dropped to 13.00 percent from 13.14</p>
<p>percent on Wednesday and the bid rate (Athibid) fell to 12.52</p>
<p>from 12.66 percent.</p>
